# The context of docker/Dockerfile is the repository root. Nothing below is an input to a
# build: outputs, caches, VCS and editor state — and credentials, which must never reach a layer.
# A pattern without `**/` matches at the root only, so every credential is written with it: the
# same list as .gitignore, at any depth.
**/build
.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode
.claude
**/.kotlin
**/node_modules

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/creds.properties
**/*.creds.properties
**/creds*.properties
**/secrets.properties
**/local.properties
**/settings.xml
**/*.settings.xml
**/*.jks
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/assets
